  "body": "VIEWINGS BY APPOINTMENT THIS WEEKEND!\r\n\r\nExceptional in scale, design and versatility, this impressive 2018-built home offers a combination rarely found in the area. \r\n\r\nSet on a freehold 611m2 (approx.) site, the main residence features five bedrooms, a dedicated study, two living areas and a stunning entertainer's kitchen with an expansive butler's pantry.\r\n\r\nAdding a genuine point of difference is the fully self-contained two-bedroom minor dwelling, currently returning $620 per week - ideal for extended family or an additional income stream.\r\n\r\nQuality and comfort are evident throughout, with double glazing, six heat pumps, a central vacuum system, generous outdoor entertaining, a double internal-access garage and secure parking for multiple vehicles.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a quiet cul-de-sac and within sought-after school zones, this is a substantial, versatile property offering a level of space, flexibility and functionality that is increasingly difficult to replicate.\r\n\r\nWhy build when you can secure the complete package now? With today's construction costs, this is an opportunity to buy established quality and exceptional space without the time, stress or uncertainty of building from scratch.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are motivated and ready to see this property sold. Savvy buyers will recognise the opportunity to secure something truly special for the area.\r\n\r\nContact Clare on 021 290 0505 to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nConjunctions welcome.",
